<title>USA: MicroTouch, IBM expand touch screen pact.</title>
<headline>MicroTouch, IBM expand touch screen pact.</headline>
<dateline>METHUEN, Mass. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>-MicroTouch Systems Inc and International Business Machines Corp said Tuesday they agreed to have MicroTouch add touch capability to certain IBM monitors for sale worldwide.</p>
<p>The companies said in a joint statement they expect to launch the first products from the new deal later this year.</p>
<p>This agreement expands the current relationship in which MicroTouch supplies IBM with touchscreens for certain IBM monitors. Under the new agreement, MicroTouch will act as worldwide distributor and master reseller for IBM.</p>
</text>
